# Student Management System

A simple web-based Student Management System built using Flask and SQLite.

## 🚀 Features
- Add student details
- View student list
- Edit student information
- Delete student records

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- Python (Flask)
- HTML, CSS
- SQLite

## 📂 Project Structure
student-management/
│
├── app.py
├── templates/
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── add.html
│   └── edit.html
└── static/
    └── style.css

## ▶️ How to Run
1. Install Flask:
   pip install flask

2. Run the app:
   python app.py

3. Open in browser:
   http://127.0.0.1:5000/

